00:59:53.050 --> 01:00:16.810
<v Ira Glass>Well, our program was produced today by Lisa Pollack with Alex Blumberg, Ben Calhoun, Sarah Koenig, Jonathan Menjivar, Brian Reed, Robyn Semien, Alyssa Shipp, and Nancy Updike. Our senior producer is Julie Snyder. Seth Lind is our production manager, Emily Condon, our office manager. Production help from Matt Kilty. Music help from Damien Graef and Rob Geddis. Special thanks today to Alexandra Berzon of the Wall Street Journal, to Katherine Gorman at WYPR, to Michelle Harris, and to Benjamin Anastas.
<v Ira Glass>我们的节目今天由丽莎·波拉克（Lisa Pollack）与亚历克斯·布隆伯格（Alex Blumberg）、本·卡尔霍恩（Ben Calhoun）、莎拉·科尼格（Sarah Koenig）、乔纳森·门吉瓦尔（Jonathan Menjivar）、布赖恩·里德（Brian Reed）、罗宾·塞米恩（Robyn Semien）、阿丽莎·希普（Alyssa Shipp）和南茜·厄普代克（Nancy Updike）共同制作。我们的资深制作人是朱莉·斯奈德（Julie Snyder）。塞斯·林德（Seth Lind）是我们的制作经理，艾米丽·康顿（Emily Condon）是我们的办公室经理。马特·基尔蒂（Matt Kilty）提供了制作协助。达米安·格雷夫（Damien Graef）和罗布·格迪斯（Rob Geddis）提供了音乐协助。特别感谢《华尔街日报》的亚历山德拉·伯宗（Alexandra Berzon）、WYPR 的凯瑟琳·戈尔曼（Katherine Gorman）、米歇尔·哈里斯（Michelle Harris）以及本杰明·阿纳斯塔斯（Benjamin Anastas）。

01:00:16.810 --> 01:00:43.570
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International. WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, with the announcement this weekend that the Car Talk guys are retiring, Torey has been reminiscing about how he never figured out why, all these years, WBEZ and all the other public radio stations have to pay for the program in cash. It's so weird, right? When you call CarTalk Plaza, this is what the operator always tells you.
<v Ira Glass>本美国生活由公共广播国际（Public Radio International）发行。我们节目的 WBEZ 管理监督由我们的老板托雷·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生负责。你知道的，随着本周末“汽车谈话”（Car Talk）节目组宣布退休，托雷一直在回忆，为什么这么多年来，WBEZ 和所有其他公共广播电台都必须用现金支付节目费，他怎么也想不通。这太奇怪了，对吧？当你打电话给汽车谈话广场时，接线员总是这样对你说的。

01:00:43.570 --> 01:00:50.350
<v Woman>You know that you can't write a check here. We won't allow you to write checks. Just bring cash. Just bring cash.
<v Woman>你知道这里不能开支票。我们不允许你开支票。只要带现金。只要带现金。

01:00:50.350 --> 01:00:54.610
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯（Ira Glass）。下周将带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

01:00:54.610 --> 01:00:59.610
